// The employer-side pilot, run on the site (FSD §5.16 FR-PLT-03..14;
// docs/framework-research/15-pilot-on-site.md).
//
// Ten recruiters and hiring managers, each holding a whitelisted
// account with the pilot flag, take the survey instrument, read a mocked
// match record and the company hiring workflow, and comment on both.
// The instrument is versioned data rendered by the site; every answer
// carries a per-item flag; comments never change the record.
//
// Every member RPC here refuses a caller without the pilot flag, unless
// the caller is an admin, who sees the pilot as a participant would.
// The admin RPCs read, export and delete whole sessions (the owner's
// own runs on the deployed build); nothing a participant wrote is ever
// edited or shown on a public page.

